title: "MYRIAD: 10,000-Node Biotech Agent Skill Graph"
message: "Please cite this software and data release if it supports your work."
type: software
version: 1.0.2
date-released: '2026-08-04'
authors:
  - family-names: "Muralikrishnan"
    given-names: "Srihari"
abstract: >-
  A machine-readable taxonomy of 10,000 atomic biotech agent tasks across 100 domains,
  with canonical and sanitized data distributions, per-node Markdown records, validators,
  a command-line interface, and three seed SKILL.md implementations. ChatGPT (GPT-5.6
  Thinking by OpenAI) is credited in the repository for AI-assisted architecture,
  synthesis, normalization, and release engineering.
keywords:
  - biotechnology
  - bioinformatics
  - agent skills
  - autonomous agents
  - drug discovery
  - genomics
  - biomanufacturing
